# Settings work

Before editing settings UI, actions, or migrations, read:

- `docs/settings/README.md`
- Feature notes under `docs/settings/` (workspace, connected-accounts, patterns, edge-cases)

## Must follow

- Use `SettingsPage` / `SettingsSection` / `SettingsRow`
- Domain code in `lib/<feature>/{types,schema,queries,actions}.ts`
- Sonner toasts with a stable id; per-field saves with race-safe rollback
- No Supabase/infra names in user-facing copy
- Don’t regress items listed in `docs/settings/edge-cases.md`
- Don’t commit unrelated WIP (teams, icon-picker, lockfile-only churn) with settings work
